  - m_Id: 5374213341831168
    m_Localized: "Last Light Below is a first-person 3D shooter where the player
      must battle the undead lurking deep within underground dungeons. The main objective
      is to venture as far as possible toward the source of the dark forces.\r\nThe
      dungeons are shrouded in darkness, causing the hero's sanity to gradually fade.
      However, magical stone slabs emitting a blue glow can provide protection. While
      standing near them, sanity does not decrease. If sanity drops too low, the
      player will begin to lose health\u2014or something even worse may happen.\r\nIn
      summary, here are the key things to remember:\r\n1. Keep an eye on your Health,
      Sanity, and Ammo in the bottom-right corner of the screen.\r\n2. Defeat enemies
      to earn **Lights** (displayed in the top-left corner).\r\n3. Some enemies take
      increased damage from headshots.\r\n4. The arrow at the top of the screen points
      toward the correct path.\r\n5. Push forward and see how far you can make it.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
